OL,4,BPorterfield leaves Lancashire after    
OL,5,Bthree seasons                          
OL,6,GWill Porterfield has left his role as  
OL,7,Glead batting coach at Lancashire after 
OL,8,Gthree years with the club.             
OL,10,FThe former Ireland international       
OL,11,Fjoined the Red Rose county from        
OL,12,FGloucestershire before the start of    
OL,13,Fthe 2024 season but was unable to help 
OL,14,Fturn the club's red ball fortunes      
OL,15,Faround during his time at Emirates Old 
OL,16,FTrafford.                              
